=Analyze the attached medical document and extract key information according to the specified JSON format.

**Document Context:**
- Document Type: {{ $('Identify Document Type').item.json.documentType }}
- Sender: {{ $('Extract Email Info').item.json.senderName }} ({{ $('Extract Email Info').item.json.senderEmail }})
- Received: {{ $('Extract Email Info').item.json.receivedDate }}
- Document Text: {{ $json.text }}

Please process this document and provide the structured JSON output.

[ATTACHED: Medical document file - MIME type: {{ $('Extract Email Info').item.json.attachmentMimeType }}]

